error[E0060]: refutable pattern in a `use` binder
  --> tests/ui/06-patterns/exhaustiveness/refutable_use_binder.cheby:10:7
   |
10 |   use Some(x) <- with_value
   |       ^^^^^^^ `None` not covered
   |
   = note: this pattern must match every value of its type (§6.1)
   = help: bind a plain name and use `case` after the `use` to handle `None` as well, or `let assert` to panic when it does not match

